<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">what resembles the grave but isn't</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora is eighteen years old. She shouldn't have to stand around waiting while Razz finishes chatting with the neighborhood "PTA moms" and drags her home.&lt;br /&gt;But. But at least. At least she has fifteen minutes or so to pop inside Catra's house and check in on her. They haven't really talked in a while, but they were attached at the hip when they were kids. Entrapta says Catra's right inside. Adora will go in and say something clever and they'll hit it off again and then she won't feel so awkward texting. And then maybe they won't stop talking even when Adora goes to that out-of-state school she's been accepted into.&lt;br /&gt;Hopefully, anyways.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>forwantofanoxfordcomma</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>General Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Growing Apart</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Needs Therapy (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra) Needs a Hug</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and also probably</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Needs Therapy (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>bildungsroman</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but also a</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Short</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Short One Shot</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sad Ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Ambiguous/Open Ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Coming of Age</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Modern Setting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Modern: No Powers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>the deleted scene set between the graduation chapter and the orientation chapter of a</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - High School</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and a</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - College/University</rdf:li>
